{"3693830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Museum Guard: Exhibit Unknown", "steam_appid": 3693830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/0704e90fe53b036b6f240ce573ca6358.avif?t=1786095970\" width=1560 height=620 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Museum Guard: Exhibit Unknown</strong> is a short, atmospheric horror game where you take on the role of a lone night guard in a long-forgotten museum. But the artifacts aren’t the only things left behind…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/f30d199102c9825986478331c1a3dacb.poster.avif?t=1786095970\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/f30d199102c9825986478331c1a3dacb.webm?t=1786095970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/f30d199102c9825986478331c1a3dacb.mp4?t=1786095970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While completing tasks, explore dark corridors, uncover hidden rooms, and restore lost memories as the museum begins to change around you. Armed only with your flashlight and your instincts, you must survive the night with an exhibit that was never meant to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/49602152fc64ee0fd1881005b347a2e2.poster.avif?t=1786095970\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/49602152fc64ee0fd1881005b347a2e2.webm?t=1786095970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/49602152fc64ee0fd1881005b347a2e2.mp4?t=1786095970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of <i>Order 13</i>, <i>The Mortuary Assistant</i>, and <i>Phasmophobia.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patrol the museum after hours… until the exhibits start moving on their own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access areas in any order, but unlocking keys and tools will reveal deeper secrets... and danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mind is your greatest weapon, and your greatest enemy. Restoring sanity may help… or hurt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate strange characters, shifting environments, and exhibits that seem to watch you back.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions matter. Will you uncover the full story or be trapped forever in the dark?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/3f5719a5fff5da069cb582a7654088a5.poster.avif?t=1786095970\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/3f5719a5fff5da069cb582a7654088a5.webm?t=1786095970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/3f5719a5fff5da069cb582a7654088a5.mp4?t=1786095970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/0704e90fe53b036b6f240ce573ca6358.avif?t=1786095970\" width=1560 height=620 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Museum Guard: Exhibit Unknown</strong> is a short, atmospheric horror game where you take on the role of a lone night guard in a long-forgotten museum. But the artifacts aren’t the only things left behind…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/f30d199102c9825986478331c1a3dacb.poster.avif?t=1786095970\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/f30d199102c9825986478331c1a3dacb.webm?t=1786095970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/f30d199102c9825986478331c1a3dacb.mp4?t=1786095970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While completing tasks, explore dark corridors, uncover hidden rooms, and restore lost memories as the museum begins to change around you. Armed only with your flashlight and your instincts, you must survive the night with an exhibit that was never meant to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/49602152fc64ee0fd1881005b347a2e2.poster.avif?t=1786095970\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/49602152fc64ee0fd1881005b347a2e2.webm?t=1786095970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/49602152fc64ee0fd1881005b347a2e2.mp4?t=1786095970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of <i>Order 13</i>, <i>The Mortuary Assistant</i>, and <i>Phasmophobia.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patrol the museum after hours… until the exhibits start moving on their own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access areas in any order, but unlocking keys and tools will reveal deeper secrets... and danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mind is your greatest weapon, and your greatest enemy. Restoring sanity may help… or hurt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate strange characters, shifting environments, and exhibits that seem to watch you back.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions matter. Will you uncover the full story or be trapped forever in the dark?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/3f5719a5fff5da069cb582a7654088a5.poster.avif?t=1786095970\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/3f5719a5fff5da069cb582a7654088a5.webm?t=1786095970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/3f5719a5fff5da069cb582a7654088a5.mp4?t=1786095970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Museum Guard: Exhibit Unknown is a horror game playable solo or in optional online co-op for up to 4 players. Work the night shift in a museum where exhibits refuse to stay quiet. Patrol halls, investiga